          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/7609.jpg"
        },
        "description": "~!The key designer of Protocol 7. While working for Tachibana Labs, he illicitly included code enabling him to control the whole protocol at will and &quot;embedded&quot; his own consciousness in the protocol. Consequently, he was fired by Tachibana Labs and was soon found dead on a railway. He believes the only way for humans to evolve further is to absolve themselves from their physical limitations and live as digital entities.  He also refers at himself as &quot;god&quot;.!~",
